    <statement><p>Solve the separable differential equation for <m>u</m>  
<me>\frac{du}{dt} = e^{5 u + 6 t}.</me> 
Use the following initial condition: <m>u(0) = 3.</m></p>
<p><m>u =</m> <fillin characters="45" name="AnSwEr0001"/>.</p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\frac{-\ln\mathopen{}\left(e^{-3\cdot 5}+\frac{5}{6}-\frac{5}{6}e^{6t}\right)}{5}</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
